<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002T_S000D" variety="S000D">
<name>Other Electrical</name>
<ttl id="1002T_S000D_742B1_T003C" variety="T003C">
<name>ETC System</name>
<para id="RM00000365F014X" category="C" type-id="803NQ" name-id="732LP-04" from="200912">
<dtccode>B15F3</dtccode>
<dtcname>ETC setup malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000365F014X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IAO00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This DTC is output when the toll collection (ETC) computer detects an error during setup processing.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.43in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.28in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B15F3</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ETC card insertion detected in non-setup state</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Setup card soft lock detected</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Setup card on-board unit management number mismatch detected</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Setup Card</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000365F014X_02" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000365F014X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000365F014X_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IAP00000">
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Error Code</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Start diagnosis mode 1. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000BY201ZX"/>)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check the error code and take the following action.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.86in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" align="left" colwidth="2.16in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="1.91in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="0.73in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Error Code</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry namest="COL2" nameend="COLSPEC2" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Action</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>93</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>An ETC card was inserted into an ETC on-board unit that has not been set up</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry namest="COL2" nameend="COLSPEC2" valign="middle">
<ptxt>Perform setup using a setup card properly issued for the vehicle</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>94</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A setup card that has already been used for setup and whose internal data is locked was inserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry namest="COL2" nameend="COLSPEC2" valign="middle">
<ptxt>Perform setup using a setup card properly issued for the vehicle</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>This error code is output if even a setup card properly issued for the vehicle is inserted 2 times</ptxt>
</atten4>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>95</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>A setup card with a different on-board unit management number was inserted</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>Check that the on-board unit management number on the setup application form matches that of the ETC on-board unit</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>At dealers capable of online setup, also check the on-board unit management number on the setup terminal</ptxt>
</atten3>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Numbers match</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not matched</ptxt>
<ptxt>Issue the correct on-board unit management number and proceed with issuing a setup card</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten3>
<ptxt>After setup, perform an operation check using the tester and a card.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000365F014X_03_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000365F014X_03_0006" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365F014X_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IAQ00000">
<testtitle>Replace Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly with a new one. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002TPV001X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000365F014X_03_0008" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365F014X_03_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA100000">
<testtitle>Operation Check
</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Area Around Antenna</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check for any obstructions around the navigation antenna assembly (top surface of the instrument panel), and remove them if present.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check for any film, stickers, etc. affixed to the windshield glass, and remove them if present.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect with ETC On-board Unit Tester</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E195388J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using an ETC on-board unit tester, check that the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly is performing wireless communication normally.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Operate the ETC on-board unit tester at a position approximately 1m from the windshield glass, on a line extending upward and forward of the vehicle from the navigation antenna assembly at an elevation angle of 67±15°. ((The distance between the ETC on-board unit tester and the antenna is only a guide)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Point the communication surface of the ETC on-board unit tester toward the navigation antenna assembly.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not bring the ETC on-board unit tester too close to the navigation antenna assembly, as communication with the tester may be established even if the antenna is disconnected.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Setup</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Perform setup.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Using ETC Card</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Insert an ETC card into the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly and check that the card is authenticated normally.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Text in Illustrations</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.41in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.72in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC On-board Unit Tester</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Navigation Antenna Assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content6><res>
<down ref="RM00000365F014X_03_0004" fin="true">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365F014X_03_0004">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365F014X_03_0006">
<testtitle>End (setup performed)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>